***( GENERATORS--BASIC

  Aggregates all basic generator modules into a single import point, providing the
  complete library of generator constructors and combinators.

  KEY DESIGN DECISIONS:

    - **Complete library export**: This module imports and re-exports all generator
      modules, making it the primary entry point for users who want access to the
      full generator library.

    - **No additional definitions**: This is a pure aggregation module with no new
      operators or equations, serving only to collect imports.

  AVAILABLE GENERATORS:

    Sequential composition:
    - 'sequence(inputList)' - deterministic playback of a list
    - 'after(Gen1, Gen2)' - Gen1 followed by Gen2

    Parallel composition:
    - 'Gen1 x Gen2' - cross-product of two generators

    Conditional/filtering:
    - 'if-then-else(Gen1, Gen2, Cond)' - dynamic branching
    - 'filter(Gen, Expr)' - conditional suppression
    - 'inputs-filter(Gen, Expr)' - per-input filtering

    Delay variants:
    - 'delay(Gen)' - adds noInputs to every step
    - 'delayLazy(Gen)' - adds noInputs only when productive

    Infinite generators:
    - 'repeat(inputSet)' - repeats the same choices indefinitely
    - 'command-ack(handle)' - acknowledges commands with given handle

    Finite generators:
    - 'zero' - immediately consumed
    - 'emptyEnvGen(N)' - N steps of noInputs

    Test generators:
    - 'plexiltest(inputList)' - sequence followed by lazy delays

)***

fmod GENERATORS--BASIC is
  pr GENERATORS--AFTER .
  pr GENERATORS--COMMAND-ACK .
  pr GENERATORS--CROSS-PRODUCT .
  pr GENERATORS--DELAY .
  pr GENERATORS--DELAY-LAZY .
  pr GENERATORS--EMPTY .
  pr GENERATORS--FILTER .
  pr GENERATORS--IF-THEN-ELSE .
  pr GENERATORS--INPUTS-FILTER .
  pr GENERATORS--PLEXILTEST .
  pr GENERATORS--REPEAT .
  pr GENERATORS--SEQUENCE .
  pr GENERATORS--ZERO .
endfm
